<title>USA: Kings Road names Aguado chairman and CEO.</title>
<headline>Kings Road names Aguado chairman and CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Calif. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kings Road Entertainment Inc named Kenneth Aguado chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He replaced company, founder Stephen Friedman, who died last week.</p>
<p>Aguado most recently served as vice president in charge of creative affairs for the company, and as a member of the company's board of directors.</p>
